      "image": "assets/images/T02-079.webp",
      "missingImage": false,
      "phrase": "走完之後，可以到附近的Vermillion espresso bar & info休息。地址在85 Fukakusa Inarionmaecho, Fushimi Ward, Kyoto 612-0881。",
