      "image": "assets/images/T02-084.webp",
      "missingImage": false,
      "phrase": "因為它不是只有秋天才值得看。接近中午時，可以安排Teuchi-udon Kendonya。地址在41 Fukakusa Ichinotsubocho, Fushimi Ward, Kyoto。",
