      "image": "assets/images/T02-110.webp",
      "missingImage": false,
      "phrase": "地址在3 Sagatenryuji Susukinobabacho, Ukyo Ward, Kyoto 616-8385。主打蕎麥麵，每人大概兩千到三千日圓。",
