      "image": "assets/images/T02-115.webp",
      "missingImage": false,
      "phrase": "或者到Yojiya Cafe，地址在2 Sagatenryuji Tateishicho, Ukyo Ward, Kyoto 616-8375，喝杯咖啡、吃點甜點。",
